  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Education Pathways to Peace in Mindanao Program (PATHWAYS) &#x2013; Philippines</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pathways is a nine-year (2017-2026) investment to improve the delivery and quality of Kindergarten to Grade 3 education in the Bangsamoro region. This investment focuses on state-building in support of the peace process between the Government and the Moro Islamic Liberation Front. It seeks to improve the capacity of the autonomous government, and other institutions, to deliver conflict-sensitive education. The investment has direct links to economic development outcomes: a better educated population will be better placed to contribute to economic growth and development in a post-conflict environment.</narrative>
  </description>
